{
 "title": "Clementine-XT",
 "children": [
  {
   "title": "Overview",
   "lines": [
    "Wavetable synth in",
    "the style of the",
    "Microwave II / XT.",
    "",
    "10 voices, 2 wave-",
    "table oscillators,",
    "13 filters, 16-slot",
    "mod matrix, effects",
    "and an arpeggiator."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Playing",
   "lines": [
    "Root page: jog picks",
    "a sound, click opens",
    "the pages.",
    "",
    "Knobs 1-8: Play 1-4,",
    "Cutoff, Reso,",
    "Volume, Prm 1.",
    "",
    "Play Assign page",
    "sets what Play 1-4",
    "turn."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Pages",
   "children": [
    {
     "title": "Bank / Play Assign",
     "lines": [
      "Bank: pick a bank",
      "of 256 sounds.",
      "Play Assign: choose",
      "the parameter under",
      "each Play knob."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Osc / Wave / Mixer",
     "lines": [
      "Osc 1, Osc 2:",
      "octave, semi, detune,",
      "bend, keytrack, FM,",
      "table, sync.",
      "Wave 1, 2: start,",
      "phase, env, limit.",
      "Mixer: levels, ring,",
      "noise."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Filter / Amp",
     "lines": [
      "Filter 1 and its",
      "envelope.",
      "Amplifier: volume,",
      "velo, pan, chorus,",
      "and its envelope."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "LFO / Effect",
     "lines": [
      "LFO 1 and 2: rate,",
      "shape, delay, sync.",
      "Effect: type and",
      "three parameters."
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "ROM and banks",
   "lines": [
    "Files go in:",
    "/data/UserData/",
    "schwung/clementine-",
    "xt/ROMS/",
    "",
    "Your own ROM gives",
    "the original waves",
    "and the bank",
    "XT Factory.",
    "",
    "Add .syx files as",
    "extra banks.",
    "",
    "Add a fresh instance",
    "after copying files."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Full control",
   "lines": [
    "Every parameter is",
    "in the browser panel:",
    "http://<move>:7700/",
    "remote-ui",
    "",
    "Open the Clementine-",
    "XT slot there."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "No ROM?",
   "lines": [
    "A built-in bank of",
    "12 sounds plays on an",
    "open set of wave-",
    "tables. Sounds that",
    "use original tables",
    "sound different."
   ]
  }
 ]
}
